WEBVTT

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:39.890
The mystery behind these strange worlds is gradually unraveling.

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:44.220
The "oddly skewed, hobby-themed worlds"...

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:48.370
...that have appeared one after another seem to be the product of Sasshi's mind.

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:53.140
So no matter how much Arumi wants to go back to Abenobashi...

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.710
...with her partner, Sasshi always thinking about taking detours...

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.380
...they'll never get out of these...

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:01.680
..."oddly skewed, hobby-themed worlds."

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:05.550
But now that they know the reason, they're good to go!

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:09.950
With their hearts as one, they jump for real this time!

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:11.260
Okay!

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:13.130
I wonder how they did?

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:21.560
Then, you're okay with being in these worlds forever?

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.340
These messed up worlds...

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.940
...where you don't even know what's going to happen tomorrow?

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:29.740
I want to go back to the world where everyone is normal.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.650
And that's where I want to think about my family and my friends...

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.980
...and about you, Sasshi.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.080
Come on, let's go home.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:43.730
But if we go back to the original Abenobashi, you're gonna move away, right?

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.350
To Hokkaido?

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:54.980
Good morning!

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.970
Good morning!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.340
It's normal.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:12.850
No matter how I look at it, it's an incredibly normal world.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.890
There aren't any robots or dinosaurs here...

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.650
...and Papa and Aki-nee aren't going to school like it's their routine.

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:19.420
Which means...

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.230
All right!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.460
We made it back!

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.400
We made it back to good old Abenobashi!

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.200
Arumi! See? See? Take a look!

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.020
Arumi? Arumi-chan?!

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.700
Where the heck did Arumi wander off to?

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.610
But, this is a high school?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.590
Ow...

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.350
What's going on here?

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:49.390
Ryun...

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.760
She's cute.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.790
Oh, I'm late, ryun!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.130
Hurry, ryun!

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.770
Wait! What the?!

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:02.030
Oh, but this cute girl's holding my hand. I'm mega happy!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.950
Ryun! Ryun! Ryun! Ryun! Ryun! Ryun!

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.970
Oh, this sensation...

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.890
You certainly are getting a rowdy start today.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.230
It is Mune-mune!

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:16.170
The lifestyle guidance teacher will chew you out for dressing that way.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.250
Come on over to the nurse's office.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.790
If Mune-mune's here...

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.820
...this isn't our original world after all.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:26.590
Well, I did sorta have a feeling that it might not be.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:28.950
There's just an awful lot of cute girls here.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.120
It's totally unthinkable for Osaka.

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.700
Oh, man...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.380
I'm super-lucky!

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:54.230
There, that should do it.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:57.950
Oh, my, why are you so red?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.330
Well, but...

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.030
I appreciate your feelings for me, Sasshi-kun...

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.070
...but my heart already belongs to someone else.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.430
Oh, where could he be now?!

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.990
No one asked you 'bout that.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.530
So I hope this will be enough for you, Sasshi-kun!

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.480
And she ain't listening to me either.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.280
Oh, a dream world.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.960
This is a great place.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.260
Ow! Sasshi!

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:26.260
Arumi!

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.790
Help me!

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.190
What the?

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:39.730
Sasshi...

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.530
Why're you so tiny? Is that fun?

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.140
Like hell it's fun! Why am I like this?!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:49.410
Or rather, why in hell aren't we back in our own world anyway?!

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:52.210
I wonder why? It's got nothing to do with me.

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.620
Yeah, it sure does! Who else would think up a stupid world like this?!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.670
Spot! Where are you?!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.170
Written as "grass" radical over "bright", it's...

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:03.550
Moe!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.710
You okay?

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.510
Spot! Spot!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.630
This is one of those so-called...

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:15.720
..."her darling pet has gone missing" situations, isn't it?!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:17.140
All right!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:17.810
Spot!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.910
Hey, Spot!

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:19.970
Yo, Spot!

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.020
Hey, wait a minute!

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.040
Sasshi!

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.250
Beaks with shades, crest and the pits...

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.980
Hey, you came too. Good, good.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:36.860
There's nothing good about it!

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.590
What're ya doing all settled down and attending class?!

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:41.090
Let's hurry up and get outta this world! There's no point in staying!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.420
Now, now, just hold it. We just got here, after all.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.510
This place has got its own charm, ya see?

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.210
What a dopey look.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.940
I'm sure you're wanting to get to know that cute girl you met earlier...

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:54.740
...and do certain things with her.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:58.440
Probably thinking nasty, shady thoughts along those lines, but...

00:06:58.780 --> 00:06:59.780
How'd you know?

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:00.520
How the hell could I not?!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.690
Listen to me, calm down and think 'bout it for a sec.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:07.950
Considering the pattern so far, don't you know that you'd never luck out like that?

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.930
You're just bound to end up having Dad and Masa-jii...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.570
...with braided hair, dressed in sailor school uniforms chasing ya.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:15.580
Sasshi-kun!

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:18.700
I just imagined something I shouldn't have.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:19.560
Yeah.

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:21.120
Sasshi-kun.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:22.670
Nice to meet you, ryun.

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.210
Nice to meet ya.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.210
What's up with the "ryun"? Talk about stupid.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.280
You just transferred, so you don't have your textbooks yet, right?

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:30.880
Amiryun will share with you, ryun.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.470
Here, turn the page of the textbook.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.010
Oh, the moe.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:38.680
Don't stare at me like that, you're making me blush, ryun.

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:40.380
Sorry.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.730
Man, this is so stupid.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.770
Now, please open up your textbooks to page 74.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.030
Sasshi-kun, you turn the page.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.930
No, you do it, Amiryun.

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:51.170
You do it, Sasshi-kun.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.130
You do it, Amiryun.

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.130
Sasshi-kun.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:53.970
Amiryun.

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.100
Sasshi-kun.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:55.910
Amiryun.

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.910
I'll turn the page!

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:01.810
All right, your attention please!

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:05.170
Does anyone know why this fried noodle sandwich is so tasty?!

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.080
Okay, Sasshi!

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.000
What? I don't know.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.420
What are you saying, you little dummy?!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.450
Why is this fried noodle sandwich so tasty?!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.690
The reason for that is...

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.290
Now, listen closely...

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:17.090
Because this fried noodle sandwich loves everyone!

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:18.460
Sensei!

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:20.430
You guys!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.770
You guys aren't rotten mandarin oranges!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:22.930
Let's eat together in the courtyard, ryun.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:23.770
Okay.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:25.200
What? Sold out?

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.690
Such good kids! You're all such good kids!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.690
It can't be...

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:30.990
That girl...

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:32.840
Hey!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.970
Here, if you want it...

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:37.570
Oh, thank you.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.580
She left...

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.750
I wanted to have lunch with you...

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:51.510
Sasshi-kun, do you like Shiotan better than Amiryun, ryun?

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.050
Shoot!

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:55.560
He went and two-timed, and got dumped like the idiot he is.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.800
I'm sorry, that's not what I meant!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.530
No! I'll never forgive you!

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.900
What?! Come on!

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.470
Okay, okay, give it up, give it up.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:03.970
Amiryun, I'm sorry.

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:05.110
Okay, okay, it's over already.

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:07.150
It's okay, it doesn't bother me anymore.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:10.080
Even if you love another girl...

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.070
...it won't change Amiryun's feelings for you, Sasshi-kun.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.740
Then don't cry to begin with!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.320
So touching...

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.050
And you! Don't be moved by it!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.620
So, just make me one promise, ryun.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.560
Please don't turn into a main character...

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.290
...who transfers to schools all over the country...

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.090
...and ultimately ends up dying, ryun.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.430
Ryun, ryun.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:27.330
What was that about?

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:28.720
Yay, ryun!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:30.960
Hey, hey, Sasshi!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.790
You're getting too into it, you're getting too into it!

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.130
Listen to me, damn it!

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:36.630
Then, you wanna go?

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.100
Ryun! Ryun, ryun!

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:42.770
Enough's enough!

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:45.810
Well, bye.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.730
Sasshi-kun, I'll see you again tomorrow.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.320
Yeah, see ya.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.280
Bye-bye!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.510
Sasshi...

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:58.960
Monster!

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.800
Help!

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.260
Hold it, hold it. It's me, it's me.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.170
Oh, it's you, Arumi.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.500
Who'd you think it was?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.370
I thought you were a rotten mummy.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:13.170
Say, you wanna know who's more scary? Me or a rotten mummy?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.250
No, thank you.

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:15.840
Good, as long as you understand that.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.040
But are ya okay like that? You're like half dead.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.850
Being human, having your health is what's most important.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:20.780
Right, right...

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:22.020
Hey, don't steal my lines!

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.510
We're gonna get outta here and get back to our world!

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.890
But we haven't found the goblin yet.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.950
So, let's find the goblin as quickly as possible and...

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:32.020
I've got a horn!

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.060
Yeah, you do.

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:35.860
"Yeah, you do" my butt! Hurry up and say so, you idiot!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.400
All right.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.760
I don't think it's gonna work, though.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.500
We won't know until we try it!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.780
Ok, fine.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:47.330
"Please, will you return us to our own world?"

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.710
Let's see, "All right."

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.950
"In actuality, we'd need various offerings and things...

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:55.380
...but we'll just put that off for now."

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.890
Don't laugh! I'm embarrassed too, but I'm doing it anyway!

00:10:58.890 --> 00:10:59.920
Sorry, sorry.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:03.690
And this time, make sure you wish to return to our own world, okay?!

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.090
I know that!

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:06.890
"Well, then, here we go."

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.900
Whoa! I don't get it, but something's coming for real!

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.640
All right, let's go!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.010
All things extant in this world...

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:25.200
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, let them be as they should be.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.210
Thus shall it be.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.030
We did it! We're back in our own world!

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:43.790
What's going on here?!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.430
I'll bet there's another goblin out there somewhere.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.640
No way!

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:49.520
I'm late, I'm late!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:53.690
Oh, Nii-chan, you're going to be late if you don't hurry.

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:57.110
Onii-chan? You're Sasshi's Onee-chan, aren't you?

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:00.050
Oh, incidentally, for the term of endearment, there are...

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.820
...Big Brother, Dear Brother, Brother Darling, Brother Dearest...

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.890
...Beloved Brother, Brother Mine, Brother, Bro-bro, Bro, Big Bro...

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:04.920
...Mon Frere, Elder Brother, and Bud.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.220
You can pick whichever one you want of the 13.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:08.260
Check it out!

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:09.790
What the heck was she talking about?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.260
Oh, I'm gonna be late!

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:13.960
Hold it!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:17.430
Sasshi-kun, good morning!

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:21.340
I'll mess this damn world up!

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.630
Just you watch, Sasshi!

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.400
I'm sorry.

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.940
That is, for calling you out here so suddenly.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:40.920
You've been looking for Spot for me, right?

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:45.160
I had no idea and I treated you so coldly in front of the co-op.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.090
Naw, don't sweat it, don't sweat it!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:48.830
No, it's all right.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.250
It was partly my fault for talking to you so suddenly.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:55.560
So, I thought we might go on a date as a sign of reconciliation.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.410
Would that be a bother to you?

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.770
'Course, it's not a bother!

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:00.210
Where d'you wanna go? Where d'you wanna go?!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.180
Oh, wait a minute.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.140
I forgot my contact lenses today, so...

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:07.480
A girl with glasses!

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:09.920
Moe!

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:14.350
It's easier for me to have this hairstyle when I'm wearing glasses.

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.120
And antennae on top of that?!

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:18.940
Ultra moe!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:21.730
Just you watch!

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:30.430
If you get scared, just grab on to my arm.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:36.180
Earthworms and frogs, all pardon me.

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.950
Stop all buses and trains.

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.950
The moon has been hidden by the clouds...

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.940
...the storm doors have been shut and the brats have gone to sleep!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:45.240
Awaken, oh monsters!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.850
Bon jour. Did you call, Madam?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.160
Damn, so that's how it's gonna be.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:53.830
Oui?

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.800
Oh, well. You two, go beat Sasshi to a pulp!

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.030
Okey-dokey.

00:13:58.970 --> 00:13:59.520
Stay away!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.710
My back!

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:09.910
Oh, Papa!

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:12.640
Oh, honestly! What're those old guys doing over there?!

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.140
Not now!

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:20.120
What the heck? There were still more of you?

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.340
You sure scared me.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:23.990
All right! Go beat the crap outta him!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.130
What the heck?

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.500
I had fun today.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:36.930
Yes.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.030
I see, I get it.

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:53.820
This time...

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:01.580
And press the button!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:07.640
I've found the first star!

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.070
Oh, no fair!

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:10.930
Oh, I've found the second star!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.510
Hey, you're right.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.670
Ooh, the third star. Four, five, six...

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:19.940
Ten, eleven, twelve, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen, sixteen?!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.580
Hey, somethings not right!

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:22.480
How romantic.

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.570
Why does it turn out this way?

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.820
That was amazing!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.800
Look at all the stars...

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:35.930
Sasshi-kun?

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:38.360
Are you okay, Sasshi-kun? Sasshi-kun?!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:40.630
Sasshi-kun.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:45.310
You finally came to.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:46.340
Mune-mune!

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:48.040
She's been waiting for you.

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:51.800
Sasshi-kun, you're all right!

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.880
You really caught me at a bad moment there.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.710
No, not at all! Not at all!

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:01.710
Sasshi-kun, your courage saved the world.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:03.480
There, take a look.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.940
Sasshi-kun!

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:08.030
Everyone...

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.800
Once, I told my friends that you were like Superman...

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.800
...and they laughed at me.

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:13.600
Really?

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:16.070
But it was my friends who were wrong.

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:17.990
Shiotan.

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:21.600
But you should take care of yourself a little too.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.500
I'm always having to tell you that.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:26.380
No kidding. I was worried, you know.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.250
Sorry.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.800
I'll make sure to dump your corpse in a garbage can properly.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:33.840
Sasshi-kun!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.430
Oh, the potted plant that I left by the window!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.060
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.100
Oh, the desk that I left by the window!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.860
Oh, the blackboard that I left by the window!

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.830
Don't put these things by the window!

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:54.660
Good morning!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.240
May Sasshi taste the suffering of Hell!

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:01.740
Die!

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.380
Sasshi!

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.520
Arumi-san?

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.590
What?

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:06.490
Doing good?

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.020
Like hell I'm doing good!

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.290
Have you got any idea what an awful time I've had?!

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.750
Is there something here that's not to your liking?

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:15.230
What in hell is there to like 'bout this stupid world?!

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:17.400
It's chock full of things that I don't like!

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.970
I hate it! I hate it! I totally hate it!

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:24.230
I totally hate this world!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.830
Arumi...

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.470
I'm sick of it.

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:32.320
All right already.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:33.490
What?

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:38.080
Actually, Shiotan has asked me to meet her under the Confession Tree after school.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:39.580
So, what?

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:44.090
Well, like, this is one of those kinds of worlds, ya know?

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:45.290
What about it?

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.130
In other words, the way I see it...

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:50.150
...if I get confessed to under the tree, I'll have cleared the game.

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:53.670
I think once that happens, the real goblin will show up.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.210
What'd you think?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:58.630
Well, if you think so, I guess that might be true.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.810
Then, we can ask the goblin to really return us to our own world this time.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.890
Would ya really do that?

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:10.900
Of course. There's no way I'd wanna stay in a world where you're having such an awful time.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.980
Thank you.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:15.820
Sasshi?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.260
What?

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.390
If something else happens after this...

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.160
Yeah, yeah?

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:24.060
I'll throw ya into a living Hell!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.790
I'll keep that in mind.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:30.740
She's already there.

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:32.940
Go on, hurry up.

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.010
Ryun!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.720
Amiryun!

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:45.930
Come to think of it, when we first met, I bumped into you too, ryun.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.480
Amiryun...

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.990
I have to say good-bye to you now, ryun!

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.820
The truth is, I'm not a normal person, ryun!

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:56.360
What?!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:02.940
The destined time has come, so I'm going back to Heaven, ryun.

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.450
Thank you for everything, ryun.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.250
But...

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:09.500
The taiyaki we ate together were delicious.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:10.790
Uguu~.

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:11.580
Uguu~?

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:18.180
By the way, my real name is HMX-12. I'm an android. Good-bye!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:19.590
Amiryun!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.640
Or rather, you've got your characters all mixed up there!

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.310
Eat taiyaki together?

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.790
Damn, I didn't know there was an event like that!

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.130
Which means, if I'd gotten together with Amiryun instead...

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.270
...there might've been events like her moving into my house...

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.100
...or getting too excited and overheating!

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:36.610
Shoot! I acted too hastily! What'll I do?!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.640
This is no time for stupidity!

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.270
Arumi, I've got one request.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:42.740
What?

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:44.750
You know, for clearing the game?

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:46.940
Can I switch from doing it with Shiotan to Amiryun?!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:47.870
Huh?

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:50.380
Well, Amiryun's a real nice girl too.

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:51.690
So, just one more time...

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:53.780
No, no, I'm not asking to start from the beginning.

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:57.180
I just wanna start over from a teeny bit earlier.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:59.250
Let me see...

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:00.920
From around the fried noodle sandwich part.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.300
No?

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:04.160
What do ya take me for?

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:06.530
Hey, Sasshi!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.230
Yes?

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:09.670
It's 'cause you're always thinking about these stupid things...

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:12.010
...we keep ending up in these messed up worlds! Isn't that right?!

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:13.770
You stupid scumbag!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.480
You said you had one request...

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.050
...so I thought maybe you'd come up with some clever idea, but no!

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.570
You want to start all over again?!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:23.640
You want me to stick a straw in your ear and suck your brain out?

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:25.030
No way...

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:27.370
To hell with this!

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:36.460
What did I do to deserve this?!

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.920
Arumi! Arumi, I was wrong!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.260
Let me go back to my own world!

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.760
I'm sick of this!

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.270
Arumi, I get it! I get it already!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:58.280
I've had it! I can't trust anything you say anymore!

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.320
She left...

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:09.370
Splendid!

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:11.930
This world is constructed very well.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.530
Eutus.

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:15.800
But this extraordinary imagination...

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:19.370
No, it's a super-realistic imagination...

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:21.740
...that's the manifestation of a libido that's about to burst.

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:23.840
Good grief. You're quite a kid.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:27.680
Am I being praised a whole hell of a lot here?

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.320
But there's only so much you can do with raw talent.

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:35.260
Without the logic to back it up, Prof. Ohtsuki will make fun of you.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:37.880
Come and study a little science under my tutelage.

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:39.440
Science?

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.400
I was just on my way home anyway.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:43.900
Stay at my place tonight.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.160
I'll teach you what scientific thinking is all about.

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:48.370
But Arumi...

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.900
No need to be reserved.

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:51.990
This must be some sort of link in our fates.

00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:02.680
Oh, by the way, linked fates are one of the most important elements...

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:04.650
...in my scientific system.

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:05.640
Remember that.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:08.050
Is that going to be on a test?

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:48.160
I never knew you could grow into a giant, Arumi.

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:49.490
It's your fault though.

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:52.290
So, where'd you go after that? What's gonna happen now?

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:54.160
I don't know! Why're ya asking me?!

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.760
But you're the one who grew into a giant...

00:23:55.760 --> 00:23:57.360
Hey, you're doing the next episode preview, aren't ya?

00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:58.230
Oh, right, right.

00:23:58.230 --> 00:23:59.330
So, the person who's supposed to do the preview...

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:01.400
...is asking a character in the show about what's gonna happen?

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:02.400
What's up with that?

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:03.100
Is it weird?

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:03.800
That's weird.

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:05.170
But if you're gonna say that...

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:07.210
...you're the one who grew into a giant and went off someplace.

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:09.040
It's weird that you're talking with me now.

00:24:09.040 --> 00:24:10.480
Kids aren't supposed to care about the logic of it!

00:24:10.480 --> 00:24:11.550
Come on, the preview, the preview.

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:14.310
What's that mean? So, what's gonna happen next?!
